[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Nimzo-Larsen Attack"]
[Variation "Nimzo-Larsen Attack: Classical Variation"]
[ECO "A01"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,hanging-piece"]
[Themes "long-diagonal"]
[Refutes "1. b3 d5 2. Bb2 Nf6 3. e3 e6 4. Bxf6 Qxf6 5. Nf3"]
[Kind "for-us"]

1. b3 d5 2. Bb2 Nf6 3. e3 e6 4. Bxf6?! Qxf6
5. Nf3? { Natural development, but the bishop that guarded the long diagonal is gone and nothing protects the rook on a1. } 5... Qxa1 { The queen takes the rook; the knight on b1 does not guard a1. }
6. Nc3 Qxd1+ { Black trades queens as well and stays a whole rook ahead. } 7. Kxd1 *
